# Common — Coding Standards

## Repository Standards

### Required Files

README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, SECURITY.md, RUNBOOK.md, .env.example, Makefile or taskfile.yml, docker-compose.yml (if applicable).

### Recommended Structure

`/src`, `/tests`, `/docs`, `/scripts`, `/infra` (optional)

## Naming Conventions

- **Files:** Python → snake_case; Config → kebab-case; consistent across repo
- **Functions:** Descriptive names required; no single-letter names (except loops)
- **Services:** Pattern `<domain>-<service>`

## Commit Message Standard

```
<type>: <short description>
```

Types: feat, fix, refactor, test, chore, docs, security.
